@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/payments
@bookingId = 48
@orgId = 1

### ==========================================
### 🚀 GATEWAY, HEALTH & WEBHOOK ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Check Booking Payment Status (Updated to /booking-status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking-status/{{bookingId}}

### 3. Initiate M-Pesa STK Push
POST {{baseUrl}}/stk-push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "254112310754",
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}}
}

### 4. Create Stripe Checkout Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/stripe/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 1,
  "amount": 1000,
  "eventName": "Tech Summit 2026",
  "ticketTypeName": "Regular Advance",
  "quantity": 1
}


### ==========================================
### 📊 ANALYTICS & STATS ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 5. Get Platform Total Earnings
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/platform-earnings

### 6. Get Event Total Revenue
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/event-revenue/1

### 7. Get Successful Payments Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/successful-count


### ==========================================
### 📋 CORE PAYMENT CRUD & FILTER ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 8. Get All Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 9. Create Manual Payment Record
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "paymentMethod": "M-Pesa",
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "QWE12345",
  "orgId":{{orgId}}
}

### 9. Create Manual Payment Record (Auto-fetched from Booking)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "paymentMethod": "M-Pesa",
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "QWE1234567453",
  "orgId":{{orgId}}
}

### 10. Get Payment By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 11. Update Payment Record
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Stripe"
}

### 12. Update Payment Status (Patch)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "MOCK_TXN_987654",
  "resultCode": "0",
  "resultDesc": "The service request is processed successfully."
}

### 13. Filter Payments by Booking ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking/{{bookingId}}

### 14. Filter Payments by Event ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/1

### 15. Filter Payments by Organization ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/org/1

### 16. Filter Payments by User Digital ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/1

### 17. Filter Payments by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/Pending

### 18. Filter Payments by Method
GET {{baseUrl}}/method/M-Pesa

### 19. Delete Payment Record
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1